01:36:20.120 --> 01:36:21.760
I want you.


01:36:54.000 --> 01:36:56.040
No.


01:37:07.160 --> 01:37:09.080
I don't think you do.


01:37:17.280 --> 01:37:18.760
I do.


01:37:23.240 --> 01:37:25.160
You just think you do.


01:39:15.680 --> 01:39:19.960
If this was the last thing
I could say to you, -


01:39:22.400 --> 01:39:25.520
- I'd tell you that I will miss you.


01:39:29.560 --> 01:39:30.760
Before.


01:39:32.800 --> 01:39:34.080
Now.


01:39:37.760 --> 01:39:40.440
And in the future we'll never have.


01:39:48.120 --> 01:39:50.720
I'll miss our conversations.


01:39:50.960 --> 01:39:55.840
I'll miss your impulsivity
and your unpredictability.


01:40:04.400 --> 01:40:06.200
I really love you.


01:40:06.560 --> 01:40:08.720
23 life cycles.


01:40:12.320 --> 01:40:14.440
Maybe we met too late.


01:40:16.400 --> 01:40:18.080
Or too soon.


01:40:20.440 --> 01:40:24.800
We keep looking at
the last image of each other.


01:40:27.760 --> 01:40:29.600
But it keeps fading.


01:40:34.480 --> 01:40:37.280
Until I no longer can see who we are.


01:40:39.760 --> 01:40:41.560
Maybe -


01:40:41.720 --> 01:40:44.440
- our longing for each other's love -


01:40:44.560 --> 01:40:48.440
- actually was a longing for change
within ourselves.


01:40:54.440 --> 01:40:56.160
Thank you.


01:41:00.040 --> 01:41:01.480
And I'm sorry.

